@startuml sequence_review
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Monthly Progress - Review scrub to a date 60 days back

actor User
participant "Scrubber" as Sc
participant "TileContext" as Ctx
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API
participant "DB" as DB

User -> Sc: Scrub to 2026-02-27
Sc -> Ctx: selectedReviewDate (debounced)
Ctx -> T: signal change
T -> C: load('review', '2026-02-27T...')
C -> API: GET /monthly-progress?asOf=...
API -> API: clamp asOf
API -> DB: 4 x SELECT COUNT per [asOf-7d..asOf-0d]
DB --> API: counts
API --> C: { buckets: [...] } + Cache-Control: public, max-age=300
C --> T: signal updates
T --> User: 4 bars + REVIEW pill at historical instant

@enduml
